INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('finos/morphir-dotnet/aot-guru', 'aot-guru', 'finos', 'morphir-dotnet', 'community', 'aot-guru finos morphir-dotnet community The aot-guru skill provides expertise in guiding development towards Native AOT support for the morphir-dotnet project, focusing on single-file trimmed executables. It helps teams make incremental progress towards this goal. AOT Guru是一种为Morphir项目提供单文件优化和Native AOT支持的工具 AOT Guruは、Morphirプロジェクトの最適化とNative AOTサポートを提供するツールです AOT Guru는 Morphir 프로젝트를 위한 단일 파일 최적화 및 Native AOT 지원을 제공하는 도구입니다 aot-guru es una herramienta de optimización y despliegue para Morphir, especializada en single-file trimmed executables y Native AOT aot-guru est un outil d''optimisation et de déploiement pour Morphir, axé sur les exécutables optimisés et la prise en charge Native AOT aot-guru ist ein Optimierungs- und Bereitstellungstool für Morphir, spezialisiert auf single-file trimmed executables und Native AOT-Unterstützung O AOT Guru é uma ferramenta especializada em otimização e implantação para o projeto Morphir-dotnet, focada em executáveis de arquivo único reduzidos. AOT Guru - это специализированная оптимизация и развертывание для проекта Morphir-dotnet, ориентированная на оптимизированные и обрезанные исполняемые файлы в одном файле AOT Guru هو أداة محسنة ومتخصصة في التخصيص والإعداد لمشروع Morphir-dotnet, محوره الرئيسي هو إنشاء ملفات تنفيذية محسنة ومخفضة في ملف واحد how to use aot-guru aot-guru setup guide what is aot-guru aot-guru alternative aot-guru vs morphir-dotnet native aot support single-file trimmed executables morphir-dotnet optimization aot-guru install AOT Guru Morphir 单文件优化 Native AOT dotnet工具 AIエージェント 优化和部署 trimmed executables Produces optimized, trimmed single-file deployments Guides development towards eventual Native AOT support Expertise in morphir-dotnet project optimization Helps teams make incremental progress towards Native AOT Supports creation of single-file executables Focuses on trimmed deployments for improved performance aot-guru is a specialized optimization and deployment expert for morphir-dotnet, focusing on single-file trimmed executables and Native AOT support');
