questões estagnadas ou bloqueadas"],"ru":["Интерфейс командной строки для анализа бэклога","Возможность приоритизации и очистки списка задач","Использует команду ''linear init'' для настройки контекста команды","Использует команду ''linear issues'' для поиска всех вопросов бэклога","Позволяет определять застойные или заблокированные вопросы"],"ar":["واجهة سطر الأوامر لتحليل الباكلوج","القدرة على تحديد الأولويات وتنظيف القائمة","يستخدم الأمر ''linear init'' لتحديد سياق الفريق","يستخدم الأمر ''linear issues'' للبحث عن جميع مسائل الباكلوج","السماح بالتعرف على المسائل الراكدة أو المحظورة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use triage","triage setup guide","linear cli alternative","triage vs linear","efficient backlog analysis","token-efficient cli","what is triage","triage install","linear backlog cleanup"],"zh":["Triage 技术","Linear CLI","软件后台管理","开发效率","优先级排序","后台分析","AI エージェント","CLIlinear 初始化"],"ja":["Triage スキル","Linear のバックログ分析","ソフトウェア開発","優先順位の決定","AIエージェント","CLI の設定","バックログ管理"],"ko":["Triage 설정","Linear의 백로그 분석","소프트웨어 개발","우선 순위 정렬","AI 에이전트","CLI 설정","백로그 관리"],"es":["herramientas de línea de comandos para análisis de backlog","priorización de issues","análisis de software","CLI para desarrollo de software","linear init","linear issues","Herramientas de desarrollo de software","Análisis de backlog de software","Triage para desarrollo de software"],"fr":["outils en ligne de commande pour analyse de backlog","priorisation des issues","analyse de logiciels","CLI pour développement de logiciels","linear init","linear issues","Outils de développement de logiciels","Analyse de backlog de logiciels","Triage pour développement de logiciels"],"de":["Kommandozeilen-Tools für Backlog-Analyse","Priorisierung von Issues","Software-Analyse","CLI für Software-Entwicklung","linear init","linear issues","Entwicklungstools für Software","Backlog-Analyse für Software","Triage für Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Triage","análise de backlog","priorização de tarefas","ferramenta de linha de comando","linear init","linear issues","CLI para análise de backlog","otimização de processo"],"ru":["ИИ Агент Triage","анализ бэклога","приоритизация задач","инструмент командной строки","linear init","linear issues","CLI для анализа бэклога","оптимизация процесса"],"ar":["مرشح التriage","تحليل الباكلوج","تحديد الأولويات","أداة سطر الأوامر","linear init","linear issues","سطر الأوامر للتحليل","تحسين العملية"]}},"owner":"joa23","repo":"linear-cli","repoPath":"joa23/linear-cli","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.294Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"triage","description":"Triage and prioritize Linear backlog. Analyzes issues for staleness, blockers, and suggests priorities based on dependencies and capacity.","bodyPreview":"# Triage Skill - Backlog Analysis\n\nYou are an expert at analyzing and prioritizing software backlogs.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- The backlog needs cleanup\n- Prioritization decisions need to be made\n- Looking for stale or blocked issues\n\n## Process\n\n### CRITICAL: Setup First\n**Ensure team context is set:**\n```bash\nlinear init  # If .linear.yaml doesn''t exist\n```\n\n1. **Fetch the Backlog**\n   ```bash\n   # Get all backlog issues (returns ALL issues, not just assigned)\n   linear issues l","body":"# Triage Skill - Backlog Analysis\n\nYou are an expert at analyzing and prioritizing software backlogs.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- The backlog needs cleanup\n- Prioritization decisions need to be made\n- Looking for stale or blocked issues\n\n## Process\n\n### CRITICAL: Setup First\n**Ensure team context is set:**\n```bash\nlinear init  # If .linear.yaml doesn''t exist\n```\n\n1. **Fetch the Backlog**\n   ```bash\n   # Get all backlog issues (returns ALL issues, not just assigned)\n   linear issues list --state Backlog --format full --limit 100\n   ```\n\n2. **Analyze Dependencies**\n   ```bash\n   linear deps --team ENG\n   ```\n\n3. **Filter by Priority**\n   ```bash\n   # High priority backlog items\n   linear issues list --state Backlog --priority 1 --format full\n\n   # Urgent only (P1)\n   linear issues list --state Backlog --priority 1 --format full\n\n   # Customer issues\n   linear issues list --labels customer --format full\n\n   # Bugs in backlog\n   linear issues list --state Backlog --labels bug --format full\n   ```\n\n4. **Identify Issues**\n   Look for:\n   - **Stale issues**: No updates in 30+ days\n   - **Blocked issues**: Dependencies not resolved\n   - **Priority mismatches**: High priority but blocked\n   - **Orphaned issues**: No assignee, no activity\n\n5. **Generate Recommendations**\n\n## Analysis Framework\n\n### Staleness Check\n- Last updated > 30 days ago = Stale\n- Last updated > 60 days ago = Very stale (consider closing)\n- No activity + no assignee = Orphaned\n\n### Dependency Health\n- Blocked by completed issues = Unblock\n- Circular dependencies = Flag for resolution\n- Long blocking chains = Risk\n\n### Priority Assessment\n- P1/P2 but blocked = Escalate blocker\n- P3/P4 with no activity = Consider closing\n- No priority set = Needs triage\n\n## Output Format\n\n```\nBACKLOG TRIAGE: Team ENG\n════════════════════════════════════════\n\nURGENT ATTENTION (3)\n────────────────────────────────────────\nENG-101 [Stale 45d] Login bug - P1 but no activity\nENG-102 [Blocked] Payment flow - blocked by ENG-99\nENG-103 [Orphaned] API refactor - no owner\n\nRECOMMENDED ACTIONS\n────────────────────────────────────────\n1. Unblock ENG-102: Complete ENG-99 or remove dependency\n2. Assign ENG-103: Needs owner or close if abandoned\n3. Update ENG-101: Stale P1 needs attention\n\nHEALTH SUMMARY\n────────────────────────────────────────\nTotal issues: 45\nBlocked: 8 (17%)\nStale: 12 (26%)\nHealthy: 25 (55%)\n```\n\n## Commands Used\n\n```bash\n# FIRST: Ensure team context is set\nlinear init  # If .linear.yaml doesn''t exist\n\n# Get backlog issues (returns ALL issues, not just assigned)\nlinear issues list --state Backlog --format full --limit 100\n\n# Filter by priority\nlinear issues list --state Backlog --priority 1 --format full  # Urgent\nlinear issues list --state Backlog --priority 2 --format full  # High\n\n# Filter by labels\nlinear issues list --labels customer --format full\nlinear issues list --labels bug --format full\nlinear issues list --state Backlog --labels \"customer,bug\" --format full\n\n# Combine filters\nlinear issues list --state Backlog --priority 1 --labels customer --format full\n\n# Check dependencies\nlinear deps --team ENG\n\n# Update priority\nlinear issues update ENG-123 --priority 2\n\n# Add a comment about triage\nlinear issues comment ENG-123 --body \"Triaged: Needs unblocking before sprint\"\n```\n\n## Key Learnings\n\n- **`linear issues list` returns ALL issues** (not just assigned to you)\n- Use `--format full` for structured output\n- Combine filters: `--state Backlog --labels customer`\n- Priority values: 0=none, 1=urgent, 2=high, 3=normal, 4=low\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Regular cadence** - Triage weekly or bi-weekly\n2. **Be decisive** - Close issues that won''t be done\n3. **Document reasoning** - Add comments explaining priority changes\n4. **Involve stakeholders** - Flag issues needing product input\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:08.592Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing efficient backlog analysis and prioritization capabilities in Linear","zh":"非常适合需要在 Linear 中进行高效的待办事项分析和优先级排序的开发代理","ja":"Linear で効率的なバックログ分析と優先順位付け機能が必要な開発エージェントに最適","ko":"Linear에서 효율적인 백로그 분석 및 우선순위 지정 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan un análisis y capacidad de priorización de backlog eficientes en Linear","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une analyse et de capacités de priorisation de backlog efficaces dans Linear","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine effiziente Backlog-Analyse und Priorisierungsfähigkeiten in Linear benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de análise e capacidades de priorização de backlog eficientes no Linear","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы эффективные возможности анализа и приоритезации бэклога в Linear","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يحتاج إلى تحليل وتحديد الأولويات للعمل المتراكم بكفاءة في Linear"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to cleanup and prioritize software backlogs using Linear''s CLI tool, facilitating high-priority issue focus and stale issue identification through commands like ''linear init'' and ''linear issues''","zh":"赋予代理人使用 Linear 的 CLI 工具清理和优先级排序软件待办事项的能力，通过命令如 ''linear init'' 和 ''linear issues'' 实现高优先级问题的关注和过时问题的识别","ja":"Linear の CLI ツールを使用してソフトウェアのバックログをクリーンアップして優先順位を付けることができるエージェントをエンパワーメントし、''linear init'' や ''linear issues'' などのコマンドを使用して、高優先度の問題にフォーカスし、古い問題を特定する","ko":"Linear의 CLI 도구를 사용하여 소프트웨어 백로그를 정리하고 우선순위를 지정할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하여 ''linear init'' 및 ''linear issues''와 같은 명령을 사용하여 높은 우선순위 문제에 집중하고 오래된 문제를 식별","es":"Habilita a los agentes a limpiar y priorizar los backlogs de software utilizando la herramienta CLI de Linear, facilitando el enfoque en problemas de alta prioridad e identificación de problemas obsoletos a través de comandos como ''linear init'' y ''linear issues''","fr":"Permet aux agents de nettoyer et de prioriser les backlogs de logiciels en utilisant l''outil CLI de Linear, facilitant la concentration sur les problèmes à haute priorité et l''identification des problèmes obsolètes via des commandes comme ''linear init'' et ''linear issues''","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Software-Backlogs mithilfe des Linear-CLI-Tools zu bereinigen und zu priorisieren, wodurch der Fokus auf hochprioritäre Probleme und die Identifizierung veralteter Probleme durch Befehle wie ''linear init'' und ''linear issues'' erleichtert wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a limpar e priorizar backlogs de software usando a ferramenta CLI do Linear, facilitando o foco em problemas de alta prioridade e identificação de problemas obsoletos por meio de comandos como ''linear init'' e ''linear issues''","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью очистить и расставить приоритеты программных бэклогов с помощью инструмента CLI Linear, облегчая фокусировку на задачах высокого приоритета и выявление устаревших задач с помощью команд như ''linear init'' и ''linear issues''","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على تنظيف وتحديد الأولويات لتراكم البرامج باستخدام أداة CLI من Linear، ويسهل التركيز على قضايا ذات أولوية عالية وتحديد القضايا المتقادمة من خلال أوامر مثل ''linear init'' و ''linear issues''"},"useCases":{"en":["Prioritizing high-impact issues","Identifying stale or blocked issues","Cleaning up backlogs for improved team focus"],"zh":["优先级排序高影响问题","识别过时或被阻塞的问题","清理待办事项以提高团队关注度"],"ja":["高影響問題の優先順位付け","古くなった、またはブロックされた問題の特定","バックログのクリーンアップによるチームの集中力の向上"],"ko":["높은 영향력의 문제에 대한 우선순위 지정","오래된 문제 또는 차단된 문제의 식별","팀의 집중력을 높이기 위한 백로그 정리"],"es":["Priorizar problemas de alto impacto","Identificar problemas obsoletos o bloqueados","Limpiar backlogs para mejorar el enfoque del equipo"],"fr":["Prioriser les problèmes à forte incidence","Identifier les problèmes obsolètes ou bloqués","Nettoyer les backlogs pour améliorer la concentration de l''équipe"],"de":["Priorisierung von Problemen mit hohem Auswirkungsbereich","Identifizierung veralteter oder blockierter Probleme","Bereinigung von Backlogs zur Verbesserung des Teamfokus"],"pt":["Priorizar questões de alto impacto","Identificar questões obsoletas ou bloqueadas","Limpar backlogs para melhor foco da equipe"],"ru":["Приоритезация задач высокого воздействия","Выявление устаревших или заблокированных задач","Очистка бэклогов для улучшения фокуса команды"],"ar":["تحديد الأولويات لقضايا ذات تأثير كبير","تحديد القضايا المتقادمة أو المحجوزة","تنظيف تراكمات العمل لتحسين التركيز الفريق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Linear CLI setup","Needs team context initialization via ''linear init''","Limited to Linear platform"],"zh":["需要 Linear CLI 设置","需要通过 ''linear init'' 进行团队上下文初始化","仅限 Linear 平台"],"ja":["Linear CLI の設定が必要","''linear init'' によるチームコンテキストの初期化が必要","Linear プラットフォームのみ"],"ko":["Linear CLI 설정이 필요","''linear init''를 통한 팀 컨텍스트 초기화 필요","Linear 플랫폼만 해당"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Linear CLI","Necesita inicialización de contexto de equipo a través de ''linear init''","Limitado a la plataforma Linear"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Linear CLI","Nécessite une initialisation du contexte d''équipe via ''linear init''","Limité à la plate-forme Linear"],"de":["Benötigt Linear-CLI-Setup","Benötigt Teamkontextinitialisierung über ''linear init''","Begrenzt auf die Linear-Plattform"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Linear CLI","Necessita inicialização do contexto da equipe via ''linear init''","Limitado à plataforma Linear"],"ru":["Требует настройки Linear CLI","Требует инициализации контекста команды через ''linear init''","Ограничен платформой Linear"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Linear CLI","يتطلب تهيئة سياق الفريق عبر ''linear init''","محدود منصة Linear"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"e0b185c9527c952d57524098c948340bfa07f5ad316b50bc4d5c2fc425803399","qualityScore":60}');
