INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('AWolf81/memory-lane/memorylane', 'memorylane', 'AWolf81', 'memory-lane', 'community', 'memorylane AWolf81 memory-lane community memorylane provides Claude Code with durable project memory, extracting knowledge locally and injecting relevant information. It benefits developers by offering persistent memory across sessions. MemoryLane 为 Claude 提供持久内存，支持 4 个类别的信息存储，并实现了 6.4 倍的平均压缩比 MemoryLane は Claude に永続メモリを提供し、4 種類のカテゴリの情報を保存し、平均 6.4 倍の圧縮比を実現します MemoryLane는 Claude에 영속적 메모리를 제공하며 4가지 카테고리의 정보를 저장하며 평균 6.4배의 압축 비율을 실현합니다 MemoryLane proporciona memoria persistente para Claude, reduciendo los costos en un 84,3% con compresión de contexto y seguimiento de costos en tiempo real MemoryLane fournit une mémoire persistante pour Claude, réduisant les coûts de 84,3% avec la compression de contexte et le suivi des coûts en temps réel MemoryLane bietet persistente Speicherung für Claude, senkt die Kosten um 84,3% durch Kontextkomprimierung und Echtzeit-Kostenverfolgung O MemoryLane fornece memória persistente para projetos, com compressão de contexto e acompanhamento de custos em tempo real MemoryLane обеспечивает постоянную память для проектов, сжатие контекста и отслеживание затрат в режиме реального времени يوفّر MemoryLane ذاكرة متواصلة للمشاريع، مع ضغط السياق وتتبع التكاليف في الوقت الفعلي how to use memorylane memorylane setup guide memorylane alternative memorylane vs competitors memorylane install what is memorylane memorylane cost savings persistent project memory context compression techniques MemoryLane AI 工具 持久内存 上下文压缩 成本节约 被动学习 零配置 Claude AI 에이전트 Persistent Memory: remembers information across sessions in 4 categories Context Compression: achieves 6.4x average compression ratio Cost Tracking: monitors API cost savings in real-time Passive Learning: automatically learns from git commits and file changes Zero Configuration: works out of the box with no setup required memorylane is a skill that enables persistent memory for Claude, allowing it to remember information across sessions in categories like patterns, insights, and context.');
