ter","TypeScript","单体仓库","Web应用","生产级别","身份验证"],"ja":["innozverse-repo-structure","Next.js","Hono","Flutter","TypeScript","モノレポ","Webアプリケーション","生産性の高い","認証"],"ko":["innozverse-repo-structure","Next.js","Hono","Flutter","TypeScript","단일 저장소","웹 애플리케이션","생산급","인증"],"es":["innozverse-repo-structure","estructura de repositorio","aplicación web monorepo","autenticación","Next.js","Hono","Flutter","TypeScript","pnpm","turbo.js","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["innozverse-repo-structure","structure de référentiel","application web monorepo","authentification","Next.js","Hono","Flutter","TypeScript","pnpm","turbo.js","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["innozverse-repo-structure","Repository-Struktur","Webanwendung monorepo","Authentifizierung","Next.js","Hono","Flutter","TypeScript","pnpm","turbo.js","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["innozverse-repo-structure","monorepositório de aplicação web","autenticação em Next.js","Hono e Flutter em projetos web","TypeScript em desenvolvimento web","pnpm e turbo.js em projetos"],"ru":["инноzверс-репозиторий","монорепозиторий веб-приложения","аутентификация в Next.js","Hono и Flutter в веб-проектах","TypeScript в веб-разработке","pnpm и turbo.js в проектах: ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["هيكل مستودع innozverse","مستودع تطبيقات الويب","التأكيد في Next.js","Hono و Flutter في مشاريع الويب","TypeScript في تطوير الويب","pnpm و turbo.js في المشاريع: أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"lastcow","repo":"innozverse","repoPath":"lastcow/innozverse","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.302Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"innozverse-repo-structure","description":"Navigate and understand the innozverse repository structure, file organization, naming conventions, and module boundaries. Use when creating new files, organizing code, or understanding where to add features.","bodyPreview":"# innozverse Repository Structure Skill\n\nWhen navigating and modifying the innozverse repository, follow these structure conventions.\n\n## Top-Level Structure\n\n```\ninnozverse/\n├── apps/                 # Applications\n├── packages/             # Shared packages\n├── docs/                 # Documentation\n├── .claude/              # Claude AI skills\n├── .github/              # GitHub workflows\n├── package.json          # Root package.json\n├── pnpm-workspace.yaml   # pnpm workspace config\n├── turbo.js","body":"# innozverse Repository Structure Skill\n\nWhen navigating and modifying the innozverse repository, follow these structure conventions.\n\n## Top-Level Structure\n\n```\ninnozverse/\n├── apps/                 # Applications\n├── packages/             # Shared packages\n├── docs/                 # Documentation\n├── .claude/              # Claude AI skills\n├── .github/              # GitHub workflows\n├── package.json          # Root package.json\n├── pnpm-workspace.yaml   # pnpm workspace config\n├── turbo.json            # Turborepo config\n└── README.md             # Main README\n```\n\n## Apps Directory\n\n### apps/web (Next.js)\n```\napps/web/\n├── src/\n│   └── app/              # App Router pages\n│       ├── layout.tsx    # Root layout\n│       ├── page.tsx      # Home page\n│       └── globals.css   # Global styles\n├── public/               # Static assets\n├── next.config.js        # Next.js config\n├── tsconfig.json         # TypeScript config\n├── .eslintrc.json        # ESLint config\n├── .env.example          # Environment template\n└── package.json          # Package dependencies\n```\n\n**Key Points**:\n- Use App Router (not Pages Router)\n- Pages in `src/app/`\n- Static files in `public/`\n- Environment vars start with `NEXT_PUBLIC_`\n\n### apps/api (Fastify)\n```\napps/api/\n├── src/\n│   ├── index.ts          # Server entry point\n│   └── routes/\n│       ├── health.ts     # Health check route\n│       └── v1/           # Versioned API routes\n│           └── index.ts  # v1 routes\n├── Dockerfile            # Fly.io deployment\n├── fly.toml              # Fly.io config\n├── tsconfig.json         # TypeScript config\n├── .eslintrc.js          # ESLint config\n├── .env.example          # Environment template\n└── package.json          # Package dependencies\n```\n\n**Key Points**:\n- Routes organized by version (`v1/`, `v2/`)\n- Health check at root level\n- Dockerfile for Fly.io deployment\n- Environment vars in `.env` (never commit)\n\n### apps/mobile (Flutter)\n```\napps/mobile/\n├── lib/\n│   ├── main.dart         # App entry point\n│   └── services/\n│       └── api_service.dart  # API client\n├── android/              # Android-specific\n├── ios/                  # iOS-specific\n├── pubspec.yaml          # Dart dependencies\n├── README.md             # Mobile-specific docs\n└── analysis_options.yaml # Dart linter config\n```\n\n**Key Points**:\n- Main app in `lib/main.dart`\n- Services in `lib/services/`\n- Models in `lib/models/` (when added)\n- Widgets in `lib/widgets/` (when added)\n\n## Packages Directory\n\n### packages/shared\n```\npackages/shared/\n├── src/\n│   ├── index.ts          # Main export\n│   ├── types.ts          # Type definitions\n│   ├── schemas.ts        # Zod schemas\n│   └── constants.ts      # Shared constants\n├── dist/                 # Compiled output (gitignored)\n├── tsconfig.json\n├── .eslintrc.js\n└── package.json\n```\n\n**Purpose**: Domain types, Zod schemas, shared constants\n\n**Usage**:\n```typescript\nimport { HealthResponse, healthResponseSchema } from ''@innozverse/shared'';\n```\n\n### packages/api-client\n```\npackages/api-client/\n├── src/\n│   └── index.ts          # API client implementation\n├── dist/                 # Compiled output (gitignored)\n├── tsconfig.json\n├── .eslintrc.js\n└── package.json\n```\n\n**Purpose**: Typed HTTP client for web app\n\n**Usage**:\n```typescript\nimport { ApiClient } from ''@innozverse/api-client'';\nconst client = new ApiClient(''http://localhost:8080'');\n```\n\n### packages/config\n```\npackages/config/\n├── eslint-preset.js      # Shared ESLint config\n├── tsconfig.base.json    # Base TypeScript config\n└── package.json\n```\n\n**Purpose**: Shared tooling configuration\n\n**Usage**:\n```json\n// tsconfig.json\n{\n  \"extends\": \"@innozverse/config/tsconfig.base.json\"\n}\n```\n\n## Documentation\n\n```\ndocs/\n├── architecture.md       # System architecture\n├── conventions.md        # Coding conventions\n├── deployment-flyio.md   # Fly.io deployment\n└── contracts.md          # API contracts strategy\n```\n\n## File Naming Conventions\n\n### TypeScript\n- **Files**: `kebab-case.ts` (e.g., `api-client.ts`)\n- **React Components**: `PascalCase.tsx` (e.g., `Button.tsx`)\n- **Tests**: `*.test.ts` or `*.test.tsx`\n- **Types**: `types.ts` or `<module>.types.ts`\n\n### Dart\n- **Files**: `snake_case.dart` (e.g., `api_service.dart`)\n- **Tests**: `*_test.dart`\n\n### Configuration\n- **ESLint**: `.eslintrc.js` or `.eslintrc.json`\n- **TypeScript**: `tsconfig.json`\n- **Environment**: `.env.example` (committed), `.env` (gitignored)\n\n## Where to Add New Code\n\n### New API Endpoint\n```\napps/api/src/routes/v1/users.ts  # New endpoint file\n```\n\nUpdate `apps/api/src/routes/v1/index.ts` to register\n\n### New Shared Type\n```\npackages/shared/src/types.ts  # Add interface\npackages/shared/src/schemas.ts  # Add Zod schema\n```\n\nExport from `packages/shared/src/index.ts`\n\n### New Web Page\n```\napps/web/src/app/users/page.tsx  # New page at /users\n```\n\n### New Mobile Screen\n```\napps/mobile/lib/screens/users_screen.dart  # New screen\n```\n\n### New Shared Utility\n```\npackages/shared/src/utils/helper.ts  # New utility\n```\n\nExport from `packages/shared/src/index.ts`\n\n## Import Paths\n\n### Within innozverse Packages\n```typescript\n// ✅ Use package name\nimport { HealthResponse } from ''@innozverse/shared'';\n\n// ❌ Don''t use relative paths across packages\nimport { HealthResponse } from ''../../../packages/shared/src/types'';\n```\n\n### Within the Same Package\n```typescript\n// ✅ Use relative imports\nimport { helper } from ''./utils/helper'';\n\n// ❌ Don''t use absolute package imports for same package\nimport { helper } from ''@innozverse/shared/utils/helper'';\n```\n\n### Next.js @ Alias\n```typescript\n// In apps/web only\nimport { Component } from ''@/app/components/Component'';\n```\n\n## Build Artifacts\n\n### What''s Gitignored\n```\nnode_modules/\ndist/\n.next/\n.turbo/\nbuild/\n.env\n.env.local\n*.log\n```\n\n### What''s Committed\n```\nsrc/\npublic/\npackage.json\ntsconfig.json\n.env.example\nREADME.md\n```\n\n## Scripts Organization\n\n### Root package.json\n- `dev`: Run web + API\n- `build`: Build all packages and apps\n- `lint`: Lint everything\n- `test`: Run all tests\n\n### Individual Packages\n- `dev`: Start dev server\n- `build`: Build package\n- `lint`: Lint package\n- `typecheck`: Type check\n\n## Adding New Packages\n\n1. **Create directory**: `mkdir packages/new-package`\n2. **Initialize**: `cd packages/new-package && pnpm init`\n3. **Name**: Use `@innozverse/` prefix\n4. **Add to workspace**: Already covered by `packages/*` in `pnpm-workspace.yaml`\n5. **Build config**: Copy `tsconfig.json` from similar package\n6. **Add scripts**: `build`, `lint`, `typecheck`\n\n## Directory Depth Guidelines\n\n### Maximum Nesting\n- **Apps**: 3-4 levels deep\n  ```\n  apps/web/src/app/users/[id]/page.tsx  ✅\n  ```\n\n- **Packages**: 2-3 levels deep\n  ```\n  packages/shared/src/utils/validation.ts  ✅\n  ```\n\n### When to Create Subdirectories\n- **3+ related files**: Create a subdirectory\n- **Single file**: Keep at current level\n- **Shared concern**: Extract to `utils/` or `lib/`\n\n## Module Boundaries\n\n### Apps Cannot Import from Other Apps\n```typescript\n// ❌ Never do this\nimport { something } from ''../../api/src/utils'';\n```\n\n### Apps Can Import from Packages\n```typescript\n// ✅ This is fine\nimport { HealthResponse } from ''@innozverse/shared'';\n```\n\n### Packages Can Import from Other Packages\n```typescript\n// ✅ This is fine (with workspace dependency)\nimport { schema } from ''@innozverse/shared'';\n```\n\n## Special Directories\n\n### .claude/skills/\nAI agent instructions for project-specific patterns\n\n### .github/workflows/\nGitHub Actions CI/CD pipelines\n\n### public/ (in apps/web)\nStatic assets served at root URL\n\n### dist/ (in packages)\nCompiled TypeScript output (gitignored, created on build)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:38.173Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing a standardized monorepo structure with Next.js, Hono, Flutter, and TypeScript","zh":"适合需要标准化的单体仓库结构的全栈代理，使用 Next.js、Hono、Flutter 和 TypeScript","ja":"Next.js、Hono、Flutter、TypeScript を使用した標準化されたモノレポ構造が必要なフルスタックエージェントに最適","ko":"Next.js, Hono, Flutter, TypeScript를 사용하여 표준화된 모노레포 구조가 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes Full Stack que necesitan una estructura de monorepo estandarizada con Next.js, Hono, Flutter y TypeScript","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack ayant besoin d''une structure de monorepo standardisée avec Next.js, Hono, Flutter et TypeScript","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die eine standardisierte Monorepo-Struktur mit Next.js, Hono, Flutter und TypeScript benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que necessitam de uma estrutura de monorepo padronizada com Next.js, Hono, Flutter e TypeScript","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full Stack, которым требуется стандартизированная структура monorepo с Next.js, Hono, Flutter и TypeScript","ar":"مثالي لعميل الويب الكامل الذين يحتاجون إلى هيكل مستودع واحد معايير مع Next.js، Hono، Flutter و TypeScript"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage complex web applications with authentication, leveraging pnpm workspace config and TypeScript for robust development, while utilizing GitHub workflows for streamlined deployment","zh":"赋予代理管理复杂 web 应用程序的能力，具有身份验证功能，利用 pnpm 工作空间配置和 TypeScript 进行强大的开发，同时使用 GitHub 工作流进行流畅的部署","ja":"エージェントが複雑な Web アプリケーションを管理する能力を付与します。認証を利用し、pnpm ワークスペース構成と TypeScript を使用して堅牢な開発を行い、GitHub ワークフローを使用して効率的なデプロイを行う","ko":"에이전트가 복잡한 웹 애플리케이션을 관리할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. 인증을 활용하고 pnpm 작업공간 구성 및 TypeScript를 사용하여 강력한 개발을 수행하며 GitHub 워크플ロー를 사용하여 효율적인 배포를 수행","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar aplicaciones web complejas con autenticación, aprovechando la configuración de espacio de trabajo de pnpm y TypeScript para un desarrollo robusto, mientras utiliza flujos de trabajo de GitHub para una implementación optimizada","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des applications web complexes avec authentification, en exploitant la configuration de l''espace de travail pnpm et TypeScript pour un développement robuste, tout en utilisant les flux de travail GitHub pour un déploiement optimisé","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, komplexe Webanwendungen mit Authentifizierung zu verwalten, indem sie die pnpm-Workspace-Konfiguration und TypeScript für robuste Entwicklung nutzen, während sie GitHub-Workflows für eine optimierte Bereitstellung verwenden","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem aplicações web complexas com autenticação, aproveitando a configuração do workspace do pnpm e o TypeScript para desenvolvimento robusto, enquanto utilizam fluxos de trabalho do GitHub para implantação simplificada","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять сложными веб-приложениями с аутентификацией, используя конфигурацию рабочего пространства pnpm и TypeScript для надежной разработки, а также использует рабочие процессы GitHub для упрощенного развертывания","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إدارة التطبيقات الويب المعقدة مع المصادقة، واستخدام تعريف مساحة العمل pnpm وال타입스크립트 من أجل تطوير متين، بينما يستفيدون من سير عمل جيت هاب من أجل نشر مبسط"},"useCases":{"en":["Organizing large-scale web applications with multiple packages","Implementing authentication in Next.js applications","Streamlining development workflows with pnpm and GitHub actions"],"zh":["组织大规模的 web 应用程序，具有多个包","在 Next.js 应用程序中实现身份验证","使用 pnpm 和 GitHub 操作来简化开发工作流"],"ja":["複数のパッケージを持つ大規模な Web アプリケーションの組織化","Next.js アプリケーションでの認証の実装","pnpm と GitHub アクションを使用した開発ワークフローの合理化"],"ko":["여러 패키지를 갖는 대규모 웹 애플리케이션을 조직화","Next.js 애플리케이션에서 인증을 구현","pnpm 및 GitHub 액션을 사용하여 개발 워크플ロー简化"],"es":["Organizar aplicaciones web a gran escala con múltiples paquetes","Implementar autenticación en aplicaciones Next.js","Optimizar flujos de trabajo de desarrollo con pnpm y acciones de GitHub"],"fr":["Organiser des applications web à grande échelle avec plusieurs packages","Mettre en œuvre l''authentification dans les applications Next.js","Optimiser les flux de travail de développement avec pnpm et les actions GitHub"],"de":["Große Webanwendungen mit mehreren Paketen organisieren","Authentifizierung in Next.js-Anwendungen implementieren","Entwicklungsworkflows mit pnpm und GitHub-Aktionen optimieren"],"pt":["Organizar aplicações web em larga escala com vários pacotes","Implementar autenticação em aplicações Next.js","Simplificar fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento com pnpm e ações do GitHub"],"ru":["Организация крупномасштабных веб-приложений с несколькими пакетами","Реализация аутентификации в приложениях Next.js","Упрощение рабочих процессов разработки с помощью pnpm и действий GitHub"],"ar":["تنظيم التطبيقات الويب على نطاق واسع مع حزم متعددة","تنفيذ المصادقة في تطبيقات Next.js","تيسير سير عمل التطوير باستخدام pnpm وإجراءات جيت هاب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pnpm and GitHub setup","Limited to Next.js, Hono, Flutter, and TypeScript ecosystems"],"zh":["需要 pnpm 和 GitHub 设置","仅限 Next.js、Hono、Flutter 和 TypeScript 生态系统"],"ja":["pnpm と GitHub の設定が必要","Next.js、Hono、Flutter、TypeScript のエコシステムに限定"],"ko":["pnpm 및 GitHub 설정이 필요","Next.js, Hono, Flutter, TypeScript 생태계에 한정"],"es":["Requiere configuración de pnpm y GitHub","Limitado a los ecosistemas Next.js, Hono, Flutter y TypeScript"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration pnpm et GitHub","Limité aux écosystèmes Next.js, Hono, Flutter et TypeScript"],"de":["Benötigt pnpm- und GitHub-Setup","Begrenzt auf d