de plantillas Mason Brick para Flutter","fr":"Guide de mise en place de modèles Mason Brick pour Flutter","de":"Einrichtungsleitfaden für Mason-Brick-Vorlagen in Flutter","pt":"Guia de Configuração do Template Mason Brick para Desenvo...","ru":"Настройка шаблона Mason Brick для разработчиков ИИ Агентов","ar":"دليل إعداد قالب Mason Brick لل AI Agents"},"description":{"en":"Discover how to create, modify, and remove Mason bricks with ease. Learn the best practices for integrating CI workflow and get started with template-mason-b...","zh":"了解template-mason-brick的功能和特点，掌握Flutter应用模板的创建、修改和删除","ja":"template-mason-brickの機能と特徴を学び、Flutterアプリケーションテンプレートの作成、変更、削除をマスターする","ko":"template-mason-brick의 기능과 특징을 알아보고, Flutter 애플리케이션 템플릿의 생성, 수정, 삭제를掌握하십시오","es":"Aprende a crear, modificar y eliminar ladrillos Mason en tu proyecto Flutter con esta guía de plantillas","fr":"Découvrez comment créer, modifier et supprimer des briques Mason dans votre projet Flutter avec ce guide de modèles","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Mason-Bricks in Ihrem Flutter-Projekt erstellen, ändern und entfernen mit diesem Vorlagenleitfaden","pt":"Aprenda a criar e gerenciar templates Mason Brick para aplicativos Flutter com este guia de configuração","ru":"Узнайте, как создавать и управлять шаблонами Mason Brick для приложений Flutter с помощью этого руководства по настройке ИИ Агентов","ar":"تعلم كيفية إنشاء وإدارة قوالب Mason Brick لتطبيقات Flutter باستخدام هذا الدليل الإعداد"},"definition":{"en":"template-mason-brick is a Flutter application template skill for AI coders, enabling the creation, modification, and removal of Mason bricks.","zh":"template-mason-brick是一种Flutter应用模板，用于Mason bricks的创建、修改和删除","ja":"template-mason-brickはMason bricksの作成、変更、削除をサポートするFlutterアプリケーションテンプレート","ko":"template-mason-brick는 Mason bricks의 생성, 수정, 삭제를 지원하는 Flutter 애플리케이션 템플릿","es":"La plantilla Mason Brick es una herramienta de desarrollo que permite la creación y gestión de ladrillos en proyectos Flutter","fr":"Le modèle Mason Brick est un outil de développement qui permet la création et la gestion de briques dans les projets Flutter","de":"Die Mason-Brick-Vorlage ist ein Entwicklungstool, das die Erstellung und Verwaltung von Bricks in Flutter-Projekten ermöglicht","pt":"O que é um template Mason Brick? É um recurso para criar e gerenciar bricks em aplicativos Flutter.","ru":"Что такое шаблон Mason Brick? Это функция для создания и управления кирпичами в приложениях Flutter.","ar":"ما هو قالب Mason Brick؟ هو ميزة لإنشاء وإدارة الطوب في تطبيقات Flutter."},"features":{"en":["Creates new Mason brick templates for Flutter applications","Updates existing brick structures and variables","Removes bricks from projects with ease","Ensures test coverage for Mason bricks","Integrates with CI workflow for seamless development","Organizes bricks in a structured project format"],"zh":["支持Mason bricks的创建、修改和删除","集成测试覆盖和CI workflow","组织 bricks 在三个位置：bricks/","支持Flutter应用模板的创建","支持Mason bricks的结构和变量更新"],"ja":["Mason bricksの作成、変更、削除をサポート","テストカバレッジとCI workflowの統合","bricksを三つの場所に組織：bricks/","Flutterアプリケーションテンプレートの作成をサポート","Mason bricksの構造と変数の更新をサポート"],"ko":["Mason bricks의 생성, 수정, 삭제를 지원","테스트 커버리지와 CI workflow 통합","bricks를 세 곳에 조직：bricks/","Flutter 애플리케이션 템플릿의 생성을 지원","Mason bricks의 구조와 변수의 업데이트를 지원"],"es":["Creación de ladrillos Mason","Modificación de la estructura y variables de los ladrillos","Eliminación de ladrillos del proyecto","Integración con el flujo de trabajo de CI","Cobertura de pruebas para los ladrillos"],"fr":["Création de briques Mason","Modification de la structure et des variables des briques","Suppression de briques du projet","Intégration avec le flux de travail de CI","Couverture de tests pour les briques"],"de":["Erstellung von Mason-Bricks","Änderung der Struktur und Variablen der Bricks","Entfernen von Bricks aus dem Projekt","Integration mit dem CI-Workflow","Testabdeckung für die Bricks"],"pt":["Criação de novos templates Mason Brick","Atualização da estrutura e variáveis de bricks existentes","Remoção de bricks de projetos","Integração com fluxo de trabalho de CI","Cobertura de teste para bricks"],"ru":["Создание новых шаблонов Mason Brick","Обновление структуры и переменных существующих кирпичей","Удаление кирпичей из проектов","Интеграция с рабочим процессом CI","Покрытие тестирования для кирпичей"],"ar":["إنشاء قوالب Mason Brick جديدة","تحديث هيكل ومتغيرات الطوب الموجودة","إزالة الطوب من المشاريع","التكامل مع تدفق العمل CI","تغطية الاختبار للطوب"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use template-mason-brick","template-mason-brick setup guide","template-mason-brick vs Flutter template","template-mason-brick install","what is template-mason-brick","template-mason-brick alternative","Mason brick creation","CI workflow integration","Flutter application template"],"zh":["template-mason-brick","Flutter应用模板","Mason bricks","AI工具","CI workflow","测试覆盖","Flutter开发"],"ja":["template-mason-brick","Flutterアプリケーションテンプレート","Mason bricks","AIエージェント","CI workflow","テストカバレッジ","Flutter開発"],"ko":["template-mason-brick","Flutter 애플리케이션 템플릿","Mason bricks","AI 에이전트","CI workflow","테스트 커버리지","Flutter 개발"],"es":["plantilla Mason Brick","desarrollo de Flutter","creación de ladrillos","gestión de ladrillos","integración con CI","cobertura de pruebas","herramientas de desarrollo de AI","agentes de AI para desarrolladores"],"fr":["modèle Mason Brick","développement de Flutter","création de briques","gestion de briques","intégration avec CI","couverture de tests","outils de développement d''IA","agents d''IA pour les développeurs"],"de":["Mason-Brick-Vorlage","Flutter-Entwicklung","Erstellung von Bricks","Verwaltung von Bricks","Integration mit CI","Testabdeckung","Entwicklungstools für KI","KI-Agents für Entwickler"],"pt":["template Mason Brick","aplicativos Flutter","desenvolvedores de aplicativos","criação de bricks","gerenciamento de bricks","integração com CI","cobertura de teste","desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis"],"ru":["шаблон Mason Brick","приложения Flutter","разработчики приложений","создание кирпичей","управление кирпичами","интеграция с CI","покрытие тестирования","разработка мобильных приложений ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["قالب Mason Brick","تطبيقات Flutter","مطورو تطبيقات","إنشاء الطوب","إدارة الطوب","التكامل مع CI","تغطية الاختبار","تطوير تطبيقات الهاتف الذكي لل AI Agents"]}},"owner":"gsmlg-app","repo":"flutter-app-template","repoPath":"gsmlg-app/flutter-app-template","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.303Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"template-mason-brick","description":"Guide for creating, updating, or removing Mason bricks with corresponding tests and CI workflow (project)","bodyPreview":"# Mason Brick Development Skill\n\nThis skill guides the creation, modification, and removal of Mason bricks, ensuring test coverage and CI workflow integration.\n\n## When to Use\n\nTrigger this skill when:\n- Creating a new Mason brick template\n- Updating an existing brick''s structure or variables\n- Removing a brick from the project\n- User asks to \"create a brick\", \"add a mason template\", \"update brick\", or \"remove brick\"\n\n## Project Structure\n\nBricks are organized in three locations:\n\n```\nbricks/","body":"# Mason Brick Development Skill\n\nThis skill guides the creation, modification, and removal of Mason bricks, ensuring test coverage and CI workflow integration.\n\n## When to Use\n\nTrigger this skill when:\n- Creating a new Mason brick template\n- Updating an existing brick''s structure or variables\n- Removing a brick from the project\n- User asks to \"create a brick\", \"add a mason template\", \"update brick\", or \"remove brick\"\n\n## Project Structure\n\nBricks are organized in three locations:\n\n```\nbricks/                    # Mason template definitions\n├── brick_name/\n│   ├── brick.yaml         # Brick configuration and variables\n│   ├── __brick__/         # Template files with Mustache syntax\n│   └── hooks/             # Optional pre/post generation hooks\n\ntest_bricks/               # Brick tests (one folder per brick)\n├── brick_name/\n│   └── brick_name_test.dart\n\n.github/workflows/\n└── brick-test.yml         # Parallel CI jobs for each brick\n```\n\n## Creating a New Brick\n\n### Step 1: Create Brick Directory\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p bricks/new_brick/__brick__\n```\n\n### Step 2: Create brick.yaml\n\n```yaml\nname: new_brick\ndescription: Description of what this brick generates\nversion: 0.1.0+1\n\nenvironment:\n  mason: ^0.1.1\n\nvars:\n  name:\n    type: string\n    description: The name for the generated component\n    prompt: What is the name?\n\n  # Add more variables as needed\n  optional_var:\n    type: boolean\n    description: Optional feature flag\n    default: true\n```\n\n### Step 3: Create Template Files\n\nIn `__brick__/`, create files using Mustache syntax:\n\n```\n__brick__/\n├── {{name.snakeCase()}}/\n│   ├── lib/\n│   │   └── {{name.snakeCase()}}.dart\n│   ├── pubspec.yaml\n│   └── README.md\n```\n\nUse these Mustache helpers:\n- `{{name}}` - raw value\n- `{{name.snakeCase()}}` - snake_case\n- `{{name.pascalCase()}}` - PascalCase\n- `{{name.camelCase()}}` - camelCase\n- `{{name.paramCase()}}` - param-case\n- `{{#flag}}...{{/flag}}` - conditional block\n- `{{^flag}}...{{/flag}}` - inverted conditional\n\n### Step 4: Create Brick Test\n\nCreate `test_bricks/new_brick/new_brick_test.dart`:\n\n```dart\nimport ''dart:io'';\nimport ''package:mason/mason.dart'';\nimport ''package:path/path.dart'' as path;\nimport ''package:test/test.dart'';\n\nvoid main() {\n  group(''New Brick Tests'', () {\n    late Directory tempDir;\n\n    setUp(() async {\n      tempDir = await Directory.systemTemp.createTemp(''new_brick_test_'');\n    });\n\n    tearDown(() async {\n      if (await tempDir.exists()) {\n        await tempDir.delete(recursive: true);\n      }\n    });\n\n    test(''generates correct structure'', () async {\n      final brick = Brick.path(path.join(''..'', ''..'', ''bricks'', ''new_brick''));\n\n      final generator = await MasonGenerator.fromBrick(brick);\n      await generator.generate(\n        DirectoryGeneratorTarget(tempDir),\n        vars: {''name'': ''test_name''},\n      );\n\n      // Verify generated files exist\n      final file = File(path.join(tempDir.path, ''test_name'', ''pubspec.yaml''));\n      expect(await file.exists(), isTrue);\n    });\n\n    // Add more tests for different variable combinations\n  });\n}\n```\n\n### Step 5: Add Workflow Job\n\nAdd a new job to `.github/workflows/brick-test.yml`:\n\n```yaml\n  new-brick:\n    name: Test new_brick\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v6\n\n      - uses: flutter-actions/setup-flutter@v4\n\n      - name: Cache dependencies\n        uses: actions/cache@v5\n        with:\n          path: |\n            ~/.pub-cache\n            .dart_tool\n          key: ${{ runner.os }}-pub-${{ hashFiles(''**/pubspec.lock'') }}\n          restore-keys: ${{ runner.os }}-pub-\n\n      - name: Install tools\n        run: dart pub global activate melos\n\n      - name: Prepare project\n        run: |\n          melos run prepare\n          mason get\n\n      - name: Test new_brick brick\n        run: dart run test_bricks/new_brick/new_brick_test.dart\n```\n\n### Step 6: Register Brick\n\nAdd to root `mason.yaml`:\n\n```yaml\nbricks:\n  new_brick:\n    path: bricks/new_brick\n```\n\nThen run `mason get` to register.\n\n## Updating an Existing Brick\n\nWhen modifying a brick:\n\n1. Update `brick.yaml` if adding/removing variables\n2. Update template files in `__brick__/`\n3. **Update tests** in `test_bricks/brick_name/` to cover changes\n4. Run test locally: `dart run test_bricks/brick_name/brick_name_test.dart`\n5. Increment version in `brick.yaml`\n\n## Removing a Brick\n\nWhen removing a brick, update all three locations:\n\n1. Remove brick directory: `rm -rf bricks/brick_name`\n2. Remove test directory: `rm -rf test_bricks/brick_name`\n3. Remove workflow job from `.github/workflows/brick-test.yml`\n4. Remove from `mason.yaml`\n5. Update CLAUDE.md if the brick was documented\n\n## Testing Locally\n\n```bash\n# Register bricks\nmason get\n\n# Test a specific brick\ndart run test_bricks/brick_name/brick_name_test.dart\n\n# Test brick generation manually\nmason make brick_name -o /tmp/test_output --var1=value1\n```\n\n## Existing Bricks Reference\n\n| Brick | Purpose | Key Variables |\n|-------|---------|---------------|\n| `screen` | Flutter screen with routing | `name`, `folder`, `has_adaptive_scaffold` |\n| `widget` | Reusable widget | `name`, `type`, `folder` |\n| `simple_bloc` | Basic BLoC package | `name` |\n| `list_bloc` | List management BLoC | `name` |\n| `form_bloc` | Form validation BLoC | `name`, `field_names` |\n| `repository` | Data repository | `name` |\n| `api_client` | API client package | `package_name` |\n| `native_federation_plugin` | Federated native plugin | `name`, `package_prefix`, `support_*` |\n\n## Checklist\n\nWhen creating/updating a brick:\n\n- [ ] `brick.yaml` has name, description, version, and vars\n- [ ] Template files use correct Mustache syntax\n- [ ] Test file exists in `test_bricks/brick_name/`\n- [ ] Tests cover main generation paths\n- [ ] Workflow job added/updated in `brick-test.yml`\n- [ ] Brick registered in `mason.yaml`\n- [ ] Run `mason get` to verify registration\n- [ ] Run test locally before committing\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:53.004Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile App Development Agents needing streamlined Flutter application templating with Mason bricks.","zh":"非常适合需要流畅的Flutter应用模板和Mason砖的移动应用开发代理。","ja":"FlutterアプリケーションテンプレートとMasonブロックをスムーズに使用する必要があるモバイルアプリ開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"스무스한 Flutter 애플리케이션 템플릿과 Mason 브릭이 필요한 모바일 앱 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles que necesitan una creación de plantillas de aplicaciones Flutter optimizada con ladrillos Mason.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement d''applications mobiles ayant besoin d''une création de modèles d''applications Flutter simplifiée avec des briques Mason.","de":"Perfekt für Mobile App Development Agents, die eine optimierte Flutter-Anwendungsvorlagen-Erstellung mit Mason-Steinen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de Aplicativos Móveis que necessitam de uma modelagem simplificada de aplicativos Flutter com bricks do Mason.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки мобильных приложений, которым требуется упрощённое создание шаблонов приложений Flutter с использованием Mason bricks.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تطوير تطبيقات الجوال الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء قوالب تطبيقات Flutter مبسطة باستخدام Mason bricks."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create, modify, and remove Mason bricks with ensured test coverage and seamless CI workflow integration, leveraging Flutter for efficient app development and utilizing Mason brick templates for structured project organization.","zh":"赋予代理创建、修改和删除Mason砖的能力，确保测试覆盖率，并实现CI工作流集成，利用Flutter进行高效的应用开发，并使用Mason砖模板进行结构化的项目组织。","ja":"エージェントがMasonブロックを作成、変更、削除できるようにし、テストカバレッジを確保し、CIワークフロー統合を実現し、Flutterを使用して効率的なアプリ開発を行い、Masonブロックテンプレートを使用して構造化されたプロジェクト組織を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 Mason 브릭을 생성, 수정 및 제거할 수 있도록 하며 테스트 커버리지가 보장되고 CI 워크플로 통합이 원활하게 진행되도록 하여 Flutter를 사용하여 효율적인 앱 개발을 수행하고 Mason 브릭 템플릿을 사용하여 구조화된 프로젝트 조직을 유지합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear, modificar y eliminar ladrillos Mason con cobertura de prueba garantizada y una integración de flujo de trabajo de CI sin problemas, aprovechando Flutter para un desarrollo de aplicaciones eficiente y utilizando plantillas de ladrillos Mason para una organización de proyectos estructurada.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer, de modifier et de supprimer des briques Mason avec une couverture de test garantie et une intégration de workflow de CI sans problème, en exploitant Flutter pour un développement d''applications efficace et en utilisant des modèles de briques Mason pour une organisation de projet structurée.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Mason-Steine zu erstellen, zu ändern und zu entfernen, mit garantierter Testabdeckung und nahtloser CI-Workflow-Integration, indem Flutter für effizientes App-Development genutzt wird und Mason-Stein-Vorlagen für eine strukturierte Projektorganisation verwendet werden.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a criar, modificar e remover Mason bricks com cobertura de testes garantida e integração perfeita ao workflow de CI, aproveitando o Flutter para um desenvolvimento de aplicativos eficiente e utilizando modelos de brick do Mason para uma organização estruturada do projeto.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать, изменять и удалять Mason bricks с гарантированным покрытием тестирования и беспрерывной интеграцией в рабочий процесс CI, используя Flutter для эффективной разработки приложений и применяя шаблоны Mason brick для структурированной организации проекта.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء وتعديل وإزالة Mason bricks مع ضمان تغطية الاختبارات ودمج سلس في سير عمل CI، والاستفادة من Flutter لتطوير التطبيقات بكفاءة واستخدام قوالب Mason brick لتنظيم المشروع بشكل منظم."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new Mason brick templates for Flutter projects","Updating existing brick structures or variables for enhanced app functionality","Removing unused bricks to maintain project efficiency"],"zh":["为Flutter项目创建新的Mason砖模板","更新现有的砖结构或变量以增强应用功能","删除未使用的砖以保持项目效率"],"ja":["Flutterプロジェクト用の新しいMasonブロックテンプレートを作成する","既存のブロック構造または変数を更新してアプリの機能を強化する","使用されていないブロックを削除してプロジェクトの効率を維持する"],"ko":["Flutter 프로젝트를 위한 새로운 Mason 브릭 템플릿을 생성하는こと","기존의 브릭 구조 또는 변수를 업데이트하여 애플리케이션의 기능을 강화하는こと","사용하지 않는 브릭을 제거하여 프로젝트의 효율성을 유지하는こと"],"es":["Crear nuevos modelos de ladrillos Mason para proyectos Flutter","Actualizar estructuras o variables de ladrillo existentes para una funcionalidad de aplicaciones mejorada","Eliminar ladrillos no utilizados para mantener la eficiencia del proyecto"],"fr":["Créer de nouveaux modèles de briques Mason pour les projets Flutter","Mettre à jour les structures ou les variables de brique existantes pour améliorer la fonctionnalité des applications","Supprimer les briques inutilisées pour maintenir l''efficacité du projet"],"de":["Erstellen neuer Mason-Stein-Vorlagen für Flutter-Projekte","Aktualisieren bestehender Stein-Strukturen oder Variablen für verbesserte App-Funktionalität","Entfernen ungenutzter Steine, um die Projekt-Effizienz aufrechtzuerhalten"],"pt":["Criando novos modelos de brick do Mason para projetos Flutter","Atualizando estruturas ou variáveis de brick existentes para melhorar a funcionalidade do aplicativo","Removendo bricks não utilizados para manter a eficiência do projeto"],"ru":["Создание новых шаблонов Mason brick для проектов Flutter","Обновление существующих структур кирпичей или переменных для расширенной функциональности приложения","Удаление неиспользуемых кирпичей для поддержания эффективности проекта"],"ar":["إنشاء قوالب Mason brick جديدة لمشاريع Flutter","تحديث هياكل أو متغيرات الطوب الحالية لتعزيز وظائف التطبيق","إزالة الطوب غير المستخدم للحفاظ على كفاءة المشروع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Flutter application setup","Mason brick organization within specific project structures","CI workflow integration for automated testing"],"zh":["需要Flutter应用设置","Mason砖组织在特定的项目结构中","CI工作流集成用于自动化测试"],"ja":["Flutterアプリケーションの設定が必要","Masonブロックの組織が特定のプロジェクト構造内で行われる","CIワークフローの統合が自動テストに必要"],"ko":["Flutter 애플리케이션 설정이 필요함","Mason 브릭의 조직이 특정 프로젝트 구조 내에서 수행됨","CI 워크플로 통합이 자동화된 테스트에 필요함"],"es":["Requiere configuración de aplicación Flutter","Organización de ladrillos Mason dentro de estructuras de proyecto específicas","Integración de flujo de trabajo de CI para pruebas automatizadas"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''application Flutter","Organisation de briques Mason dans des structures de projet spécifiques","Intégration de workflow de CI pour des tests automatisés"],"de":["Benötigt Flutter-Anwendungskonfiguration","Mason-Stein-Organisation innerhalb spezifischer Projektstrukturen","CI-Workflow-Integration für automatisierte Tests"],"pt":["Requer configuração de aplicativo Flutter","Organização de brick do Mason dentro de estruturas de projeto específicas","Integração de workflow de CI para testes automatizados"],"ru":["Требует настройки приложения Flutter","Организация Mason brick в рамках конкретных структур проекта","Интеграция в рабочий процесс CI для автоматизированного тестирования"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد تطبيق Flutter","تنظيم Mason brick داخل هياكل مشروع محددة","دمج سير عمل CI للاختبار الآلي"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"7f5bc93c91d686a91ad8260c4c82b4cdfa3f7b204561a5ed4bbfd3d81ac7dfe1","qualityScore":60}');
