INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('mysticaltech/terraform-hcloud-kube-hetzner/review-pr', 'review-pr', 'mysticaltech', 'terraform-hcloud-kube-hetzner', 'community', 'review-pr mysticaltech terraform-hcloud-kube-hetzner community The review-pr skill provides security-focused PR review following CLAUDE.md guidelines, checking for breaking changes and malicious code patterns. It benefits developers and project maintainers by ensuring code quality and backward compatibility. Review PR是一种安全审查工具，帮助开发者优化Kubernetes安全审查和维护 Review PRは、開発者がKubernetesのセキュリティレビューを最適化し、メンテナンスを簡素化するのに役立つAIエージェントです Review PR는 개발자가 Kubernetes 보안 리뷰를 최적화하고 유지 보수를 간소화하는 데 도움이 되는 AI 도구입니다 Review-pr es una herramienta de revisión de solicitudes de extracción que sigue las pautas de CLAUDE.md para garantizar la seguridad y la calidad del código en proyectos de Kubernetes Review-pr est un outil d''examen des demandes d''extraction qui suit les directives de CLAUDE.md pour assurer la sécurité et la qualité du code dans les projets Kubernetes Review-pr ist ein Tool zur Überprüfung von Pull-Requests, das die Richtlinien von CLAUDE.md befolgt, um die Sicherheit und Codequalität in Kubernetes-Projekten zu gewährleisten O review-pr é uma ferramenta de análise de segurança para pull requests que verifica alterações de quebra, padrões de código maliciosos e compatibilidade backwards Review-pr - это инструмент анализа безопасности для запросов на слияние, который проверяет нарушения, вредоносные шаблоны кода и обратную совместимость review-pr هو أداة لتحليل الأمان لطلبات السحب التي تحقق التغييرات التي قد تسبب مشاكل、アمان ونسق ذو صلة معاكس how to use review-pr review-pr setup guide review-pr alternative review-pr vs gitgate review-pr install what is review-pr review-pr security features CLAUDE.md guidelines PR review best practices Review PR Kubernetes安全审查 AI工具 CLAUDE.md 命令行接口 代码质量检查 后向兼容性检查 破坏性更改防止 恶意代码检测 Checks for breaking changes and malicious code patterns using CLAUDE.md guidelines Ensures backward compatibility and code quality Supports security-focused PR review with a single command: /review-pr <number> Warns against coordinated attacks and social engineering attempts Follows established guidelines to prevent malicious sabotage attempts review-pr is a security-focused PR review skill that checks for breaking changes, malicious code patterns, and code quality, following CLAUDE.md guidelines to prevent sabotage attempts.');
