ção","Integração com a biblioteca RAS-Commander"],"ru":["Автоматизация HEC-RAS 6.x","Доступ к данным HDF с помощью Python","Анализ вывода Project Inspector","Генерация планов выполнения","Интеграция с библиотекой RAS-Commander"],"ar":["تشغيل HEC-RAS 6.x تلقائي","وصول إلى بيانات HDF باستخدام Python","تحليل مخرجات Project Inspector","توليد خطط التشغيل","التكامل مع مكتبة RAS-Commander"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use hecras_plan_execution","hecras_plan_execution setup guide","HEC-RAS execution planning","Python API for HEC-RAS","HDF data integration","hecras_plan_execution vs RAS-Commander","hecras_plan_execution install","automating HEC-RAS execution","HEC-RAS 6.x execution strategy"],"zh":["HEC-RAS 执行计划","RAS-Commander 库","Python API","HDF 数据","项目检查员","执行策略","AIエージェント"],"ja":["HEC-RAS 実行計画","RAS-Commander ライブラリ","Python API","HDF データ","プロジェクトインスペクター","実行戦略","AIエージェント"],"ko":["HEC-RAS 실행 계획","RAS-Commander 라이브러리","Python API","HDF 데이터","프로젝트 인スペク터","실행 전략","AI 에이전트"],"es":["hecras_plan_execution","Automatización de HEC-RAS","Python para HEC-RAS","RAS-Commander","Acceso a datos HDF","Planificación de la ejecución de HEC-RAS","Inspector de Proyectos","Herramientas de AI para HEC-RAS"],"fr":["hecras_plan_execution","Automatisation de HEC-RAS","Python pour HEC-RAS","RAS-Commander","Accès aux données HDF","Planification de l''exécution de HEC-RAS","Inspecteur de Projets","Outils d''IA pour HEC-RAS"],"de":["hecras_plan_execution","Automatisierung von HEC-RAS","Python für HEC-RAS","RAS-Commander","Zugriff auf HDF-Daten","Planung der Ausführung von HEC-RAS","Projekt-Inspector","KI-Tools für HEC-RAS"],"pt":["hecras_plan_execution","HEC-RAS 6.x","automação de HEC-RAS","acesso a dados HDF","Python","RAS-Commander","Project Inspector"],"ru":["hecras_plan_execution","HEC-RAS 6.x","автоматизация HEC-RAS","доступ к данным HDF","Python","RAS-Commander","Project Inspector","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["hecras_plan_execution","HEC-RAS 6.x","تشغيل HEC-RAS تلقائي","وصول إلى بيانات HDF","Python","RAS-Commander","Project Inspector","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"gpt-cmdr","repo":"ras-commander","repoPath":"gpt-cmdr/ras-commander","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.309Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"hecras_plan_execution","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Planning HEC-RAS Execution\n\nDecision support for selecting optimal HEC-RAS execution strategy. Analyzes Project Inspector output and generates actionable execution plans.\n\n## Primary Sources\n\n**DO NOT duplicate content from primary sources. This skill is a lightweight navigator.**\n\n- **`.claude/rules/hec-ras/execution.md`** - Complete execution mode documentation\n- **`.claude/agents/hecras-project-inspector.md`** - Project Intelligence Report schema\n- **`.claude/skills/hecras_compute_rascontro","body":"# Planning HEC-RAS Execution\n\nDecision support for selecting optimal HEC-RAS execution strategy. Analyzes Project Inspector output and generates actionable execution plans.\n\n## Primary Sources\n\n**DO NOT duplicate content from primary sources. This skill is a lightweight navigator.**\n\n- **`.claude/rules/hec-ras/execution.md`** - Complete execution mode documentation\n- **`.claude/agents/hecras-project-inspector.md`** - Project Intelligence Report schema\n- **`.claude/skills/hecras_compute_rascontrol/SKILL.md`** - Legacy HEC-RAS (< 6.0)\n\n---\n\n## Mode Selection Decision Tree\n\n```\n1. Is HEC-RAS version < 6.0?\n   YES -> Use RasControl (hecras_compute_rascontrol skill)\n   NO  -> Continue\n\n2. How many runnable plans?\n   ZERO    -> Report blockers, stop\n   ONE     -> compute_plan() [+ stream_callback if monitoring needed]\n   MULTIPLE -> Continue to step 3\n\n3. Multiple Plan Decision:\n   Debugging/diagnosing? -> compute_test_mode()\n   Have remote workers?  -> compute_parallel_remote()\n   Production/batch?     -> compute_parallel()\n```\n\n### Mode Selection Matrix\n\n| Context | Plans | Mode | Rationale |\n|---------|-------|------|-----------|\n| Debugging | Any | `compute_test_mode()` | Sequential, single folder |\n| Single plan, monitoring | 1 | `compute_plan()` + callback | Real-time output |\n| Single plan, quick | 1 | `compute_plan()` | Simplest API |\n| Multiple plans, production | 2+ | `compute_parallel()` | Fastest throughput |\n| Distributed infrastructure | 2+ | `compute_parallel_remote()` | Scale-out |\n| HEC-RAS < 6.0 | Any | `RasControl` | COM-based required |\n| Resume interrupted | 2+ | `compute_parallel(skip_existing=True)` | Skips completed |\n\n---\n\n## Input: Project Intelligence Report\n\nExpected input from Project Inspector Agent:\n\n```markdown\n## Plans Analysis\n| Plan | Title | Status | Geometry | Flow | Issues |\n|------|-------|--------|----------|------|--------|\n| 01 | Baseline | Runnable | g01 | u01 | None |\n| 02 | Future | Missing geom | g03 (MISSING) | u02 | Geometry file not found |\n\n### Execution Readiness\n- **Ready to Run**: 01, 03\n- **Blocked**: 02 (missing geometry g03)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Output: Execution Plan\n\nGenerate structured execution plans in this format:\n\n```markdown\n# Execution Plan\n\n## Recommended Mode\n`compute_parallel()` - Multiple runnable plans, production context\n\n## Execution Order\n1. Plan 01 (Baseline) - Ready\n2. Plan 03 (Modified) - Ready\n   [Skip: Plan 02 - blocked by missing geometry g03]\n\n## Parameters\n```python\nRasCmdr.compute_parallel(\n    plans_to_run=[\"01\", \"03\"],\n    max_workers=2,\n    num_cores=4,\n    force_rerun=False,\n    verify=True\n)\n```\n\n## Prerequisites\n- None for runnable plans\n\n## Blockers (Cannot Run)\n| Plan | Issue | Resolution |\n|------|-------|------------|\n| 02 | Missing geometry g03 | Create geometry file or fix reference |\n\n## Warnings\n- Plan 02 blocked until g03 is created\n```\n\n---\n\n## Parameter Recommendation\n\n### Worker/Core Allocation\n\n| System Cores | Model Type | `max_workers` | `num_cores` |\n|--------------|------------|---------------|-------------|\n| 4-8 | 1D | 2-4 | 2 |\n| 8-16 | 2D | 2-4 | 4 |\n| 16+ | Mixed | 4-6 | 4 |\n\n**Formula**: `max_workers = min(num_plans, total_cores // num_cores)`\n\n### Geometry Flags\n\n| Scenario | `clear_geompre` | `force_geompre` |\n|----------|-----------------|-----------------|\n| Geometry unchanged | `False` | `False` |\n| Minor edits (Manning''s n) | `True` | `False` |\n| Major changes (new mesh) | `False` | `True` |\n| Geometry corruption | `False` | `True` |\n\n### Skip/Rerun Flags\n\n| Scenario | `force_rerun` | `skip_existing` |\n|----------|---------------|-----------------|\n| Normal (smart skip) | `False` | `False` |\n| Force fresh results | `True` | `False` |\n| Resume interrupted | `False` | `True` |\n\n---\n\n## Dependency Analysis\n\n### Check for Blockers\n\n```python\ndef get_runnable_plans(plan_df):\n    \"\"\"Identify which plans can execute.\"\"\"\n    runnable, blocked = [], {}\n\n    for _, plan in plan_df.iterrows():\n        plan_num = plan[''plan_number'']\n        geom_ok = Path(plan[''Geom Path'']).exists() if plan.get(''Geom Path'') else True\n        flow_ok = Path(plan[''Flow Path'']).exists() if plan.get(''Flow Path'') else True\n\n        if geom_ok and flow_ok:\n            runnable.append(plan_num)\n        else:\n            blocked[plan_num] = \"Missing geometry\" if not geom_ok else \"Missing flow\"\n\n    return runnable, blocked\n```\n\n### Dependencies to Consider\n\n1. **Shared Geometry** - Plans using same geometry can run in parallel\n2. **Upstream/Downstream** - Cascade models need sequential execution\n3. **DSS Dependencies** - Plans reading same DSS may conflict\n\n---\n\n## Context-Specific Templates\n\n### Debugging Context\n\n```python\nRasCmdr.compute_test_mode(\n    plans_to_run=[\"01\", \"02\", \"03\"],\n    dest_folder_suffix=\"[Debug]\",\n    num_cores=2,\n    verify=True\n)\n```\n\n### Production Context\n\n```python\nRasCmdr.compute_parallel(\n    plans_to_run=[\"01\", \"02\", \"03\"],\n    max_workers=4,\n    num_cores=4,\n    verify=True\n)\n```\n\n### Monitoring Context\n\n```python\nfrom ras_commander.callbacks import ConsoleCallback\n\nRasCmdr.compute_plan(\n    \"01\",\n    stream_callback=ConsoleCallback(verbose=True),\n    verify=True\n)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Blockers\n\n| Blocker | Resolution |\n|---------|------------|\n| Missing geometry file | Create geometry or fix .prj reference |\n| Missing flow file | Create flow file or fix reference |\n| Missing DSS file | Download/create DSS or update path |\n| Geometry HDF outdated | Run with `force_geompre=True` |\n| Results already current | Use `force_rerun=True` if needed |\n| HEC-RAS < 6.0 | Use RasControl skill instead |\n\n---\n\n## Integration\n\n### Upstream Skills\n- **hecras-project-inspector** - Generates intelligence report\n- **dss_read_boundary-data** - Validates boundary conditions\n- **qa_repair_geometry** - Fixes geometry blockers\n\n### Downstream Skills\n- **hecras_compute_plans** - Runs the execution plan\n- **hecras_compute_remote** - Distributed execution\n- **hecras_extract_results** - Post-execution analysis\n- **hecras_parse_compute-messages** - Interpret execution results\n\n---\n\n## See Also\n\n- **`.claude/rules/hec-ras/execution.md`** - Complete parameter documentation\n- **`.claude/agents/hecras-project-inspector.md`** - Input format details\n- **`examples/113_parallel_execution.ipynb`** - Working parallel example\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:02:26.837Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Hydrological Analysis Agents requiring strategic HEC-RAS execution planning and Python-driven decision support.","zh":"适用于需要战略性HEC-RAS执行规划和Python驱动决策支持的水文分析代理。","ja":"HEC-RASの戦略的な実行計画とPythonによる意思決定サポートを必要とする水文分析エージェントに最適。","ko":"전략적인 HEC-RAS 실행 계획 및 Python 기반 의사 결정을 지원하는 수문 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Análisis Hidrológico que requieren una planificación estratégica de ejecución de HEC-RAS y un soporte de decisión impulsado por Python.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Analyse Hydrologique nécessitant une planification stratégique d''exécution de HEC-RAS et un support de décision piloté par Python.","de":"Ideal für Hydrologische Analyseagenten, die eine strategische Ausführungsplanung von HEC-RAS und eine Python-gesteuerte Entscheidungsunterstützung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise Hidrológica que requerem planejamento estratégico de execução do HEC-RAS e suporte de decisão impulsionado por Python.","ru":"Идеально для агентов гидрологического анализа, требующих стратегического планирования выполнения HEC-RAS и принятия решений на основе Python.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل الهيدرولوجي التي تتطلب تخطيطا استراتيجيا لتطبيق HEC-RAS ودعم اتخاذ القرارات بواسطة Python."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze Project Inspector output and generate actionable execution plans using Python, optimizing HEC-RAS execution strategies through data-driven decision making and protocol adherence.","zh":"赋予代理分析项目检查员输出并使用Python生成可执行的执行计划，通过数据驱动的决策和协议遵守优化HEC-RAS执行策略。","ja":"エージェントがプロジェクト・インスペクターの出力結果を分析し、Pythonを使用して実行可能な実行計画を生成できるようにし、データドリブンの意思決定とプロトコルの遵守によりHEC-RASの実行戦略を最適化する。","ko":"에이전트가 프로젝트 인스펙터 출력을 분석하고 Python을 사용하여 실행 가능한 실행 계획을 생성할 수 있도록 하여 데이터 주도 의사 결정 및 프로토콜 준수를 통해 HEC-RAS 실행 전략을 최적화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar la salida del Inspector de Proyectos y generar planes de ejecución accionables utilizando Python, optimizando las estrategias de ejecución de HEC-RAS a través de la toma de decisiones basada en datos y el cumplimiento de protocolos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser la sortie de l''Inspecteur de Projet et de générer des plans d''exécution actionnables en utilisant Python, en optimisant les stratégies d''exécution de HEC-RAS grâce à la prise de décision basée sur les données et au respect des protocoles.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Ausgabe des Projekt-Inspektors zu analysieren und handhabbare Ausführungspläne unter Verwendung von Python zu generieren, indem die Ausführungsstrategien von HEC-RAS durch datengetriebene Entscheidungsfindung und Protokollkonformität optimiert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisarem a saída do Project Inspector e gerarem planos de execução ação utilizand Python, otimizando as estratégias de execução do HEC-RAS por meio de tomada de decisões baseada em dados e aderência a protocolos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать выходные данные Project Inspector и генерировать планы выполнения действий с использованием Python, оптимизируя стратегии выполнения HEC-RAS посредством принятия решений на основе данных и соблюдения протоколов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تحليل إخراج مشرف المشروع وتوليد خطط تنفيذ قابلة للتنفيذ باستخدام Python، وبتحسين استراتيجيات تنفيذ HEC-RAS من خلال اتخاذ القرارات القائمة على البيانات وموافقة البروتوكول."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating HEC-RAS execution strategy selection","Generating execution plans based on Project Inspector output","Optimizing hydrological model runs with informed execution planning"],"zh":["自动化HEC-RAS执行策略选择","基于项目检查员输出生成执行计划","通过明智的执行规划优化水文模型运行"],"ja":["HEC-RASの実行戦略の選択を自動化する","プロジェクト・インスペクターの出力結果に基づいて実行計画を生成する","インフォームドな実行計画により水文モデルの実行を最適化する"],"ko":["HEC-RAS 실행 전략 선택 자동화","프로젝트 인스펙터 출력에 기반한 실행 계획 생성","정보에 의한 실행 계획으로 수문 모델 실행 최적화"],"es":["Automatizar la selección de la estrategia de ejecución de HEC-RAS","Generar planes de ejecución en función de la salida del Inspector de Proyectos","Optimizar las ejecuciones del modelo hidrológico con una planificación de ejecución informada"],"fr":["Automatiser la sélection de la stratégie d''exécution de HEC-RAS","Générer des plans d''exécution en fonction de la sortie de l''Inspecteur de Projet","Optimiser les exécutions du modèle hydrologique avec une planification d''exécution éclairée"],"de":["Automatisierung der Auswahl der Ausführungsstrategie von HEC-RAS","Generieren von Ausführungsplänen basierend auf der Ausgabe des Projekt-Inspektors","Optimierung der Ausführungen des hydrologischen Modells mit einer informierten Ausführungsplanung"],"pt":["Automatizar a seleção da estratégia de execução do HEC-RAS","Gerar planos de execução com base na saída do Project Inspector","Otimizar execuções de modelos hidrológicos com planejamento de execução informado"],"ru":["Автоматизировать выбор стратегии выполнения HEC-RAS","Генерировать планы выполнения на основе выходных данных Project Inspector","Оптимизировать выполнение гидрологических моделей с информированным планированием выполнения"],"ar":["أتمتة اختيار استراتيجية تنفيذ HEC-RAS","إنتاج خطط تنفيذ بناءً على إخراج مشرف المشروع","تحسين تشغيل نماذج الهيدرولوجيا مع تخطيط تنفيذ محدث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python compatibility","Dependent on Project Inspector output schema","Specific to HEC-RAS execution planning"],"zh":["需要Python兼容性","依赖于项目检查员输出模式","特定于HEC-RAS执行规划"],"ja":["Pythonの互換性が必要","プロジェクト・インスペクターの出力スキーマに依存する","HEC-RASの実行計画に特有"],"ko":["Python 호환성 필요","프로젝트 인스펙터 출력 스키마에 의존","HEC-RAS 실행 계획에 특정"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con Python","Dependiente del esquema de salida del Inspector de Proyectos","Específico para la planificación de la ejecución de HEC-RAS"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec Python","Dépendant du schéma de sortie de l''Inspecteur de Projet","Spécifique à la planification d''exécution de HEC-RAS"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Kompatibilität","Abhängig vom Ausgabeschema des Projekt-Inspektors","Spezifisch für die Ausführungsplanung von HEC-RAS"],"pt":["Requer compatibilidade com Python","Dependente do esquema de saída do Project Inspector","Específico para planejamento de execução do HEC-RAS"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с Python","Зависит от схемы выходных данных Project Inspector","Конкретно для планирования выполнения HEC-RAS"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقا مع Python","يعتمد على مخطط إخراج مشرف المشروع","محدد لتخطيط تنفيذ HEC-RAS"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"a692217acd0d600749e69c931c5ee140eaaf1181a4000cd9ea36c329dd7133d5","qualityScore":60}');
