INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('gpt-cmdr/ras-commander/hecras_plan_execution', 'hecras_plan_execution', 'gpt-cmdr', 'ras-commander', 'community', 'hecras_plan_execution gpt-cmdr ras-commander community The hecras_plan_execution skill provides decision support for selecting optimal HEC-RAS execution strategies, analyzing Project Inspector output and generating execution plans using Python. HEC-RAS 执行计划提供决策支持，分析项目检查员输出并生成可执行的计划 HEC-RAS 実行計画は、プロジェクトインスペクターの出力の分析と実行可能な計画の生成を提供する HEC-RAS 실행 계획은 프로젝트 인スペк터 출력을 분석하고 실행 가능한 계획을 생성합니다 La biblioteca RAS-Commander proporciona una API de Python para automatizar HEC-RAS 6.x y acceder a datos HDF La bibliothèque RAS-Commander fournit une API Python pour automatiser HEC-RAS 6.x et accéder aux données HDF Die RAS-Commander-Bibliothek bietet eine Python-API für die Automatisierung von HEC-RAS 6.x und den Zugriff auf HDF-Daten O hecras_plan_execution fornece uma API Python para automação de HEC-RAS 6.x e acesso a dados HDF hecras_plan_execution предоставляет Python API для автоматизации HEC-RAS 6.x и доступа к данным HDF يوفر hecras_plan_execution واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Python لتشغيل HEC-RAS 6.x ووصول إلى بيانات HDF how to use hecras_plan_execution hecras_plan_execution setup guide HEC-RAS execution planning Python API for HEC-RAS HDF data integration hecras_plan_execution vs RAS-Commander hecras_plan_execution install automating HEC-RAS execution HEC-RAS 6.x execution strategy HEC-RAS 执行计划 RAS-Commander 库 Python API HDF 数据 项目检查员 执行策略 AIエージェント Analyzes Project Inspector output for informed decision-making Generates actionable execution plans for HEC-RAS 6.x Utilizes Python API for automation and integration Accesses HDF data for efficient execution planning Integrates with RAS-Commander library for streamlined workflows Provides decision support for optimal HEC-RAS execution strategy selection hecras_plan_execution is a Python API for automating HEC-RAS 6.x execution planning, utilizing HDF data and built with large language models.');
